      "value": "@{5abb264f453b9a30f3e2a2e7|full_name}: Then what is for this game? In unity all you get for a good indicator is the frame debug menu which gives you drawcalls, and each material and shader registers as a drawcall. When performance is talked about, even by the devs, it's in drawcalls. For this game in particular, what would be a better measure of performance per avatar when there isn't much info the game nor unity gives you?",
