      "value": "@{5a4b034d1ab4366d42644996|full_name}: You're right in a general case scenario where most of the times the limit is the gpu, but in this game so far most of the times you're limited by the cpu (in a usual day my 980 never goes up to 50% usage, meanwhile one core is being hammered), so the time spent by the cpu for the draw calls is a bit more valuable here since is the main limit so far.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
